      "message": "test(mcp): locate refusal leaves the document unchanged; a pickable mate still seats\n\nReview round on PR #863: the pinning test now also asserts get_job is\nequal before and after the refused locate, that the boss's flat bottom\nseats on the vise top at Z 20, and that one undo restores the\nplacements (the refusal added no History step).\n\nRefs #692\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
